              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 6.2-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio Musa akobosia Wele ali, “Naaba ne enja khu Baisiraeli mala nababoolela ndi ‘Wele owe bakuuka benywe andumire khwinywe,’ ne bandeeba bali, ‘Lisina liewe bali naanu?’ Mbaboolela ndi siina?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
