                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wele akobosia Musa ali, “Ese Niise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ese Niise:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ese niye oli ese. . . ESE, namwe Ese niye ese. “ESE” lilomekha nga lisina lie Lueburania lilaangwa Yhwh, lilianasibwa khulaangwa khukhwama khale bali Yehoba. Mu bibilia muno khuli ne lisina “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi”, mu bweyaangu bwe lisina Yhwh, namwe Yehoba lino.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Boolela Baisiraeli oli, ‘ESE, andumire khwinywe.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi Wele aboolela Musa ali, “Boolela Baisiraeli oli ‘Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka benywe, Wele owa Aburahamu, Isaaka, ne Yakobo, andumire khwinywe.’ Lino nilio lisina liase lia mindali na mindali. Ndimanyikhana ne lisina lino khu selukho choosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khoche obuusie basaakhulu Baisiraeli alala mala obaboolele oli, ‘Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka benywe, Wele owa Aburahamu, Isaaka ne Yakobo, ambonekheele. Amboleele ali namuloleelesie mala naboone niko Bamisiri balikho bamukhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndikho ndaka ndi enja khumurusia mu butinyu nibwo mulimo mu Misiri, mala emuyile mu sibala nisio kamabeele ne bubuukhi biseleetekhanga, sibala sie Bakanaani, Bahiti, Baamori, Baperisi, Bahibi, ne Bayebusi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Basaakhulu be Baisiraeli bacha khu khurekeeresia. Khwako okhoya oche ne basaakhulu be Baisiraeli khu mwami owe Misiri mala omuboolele oli, ‘Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe Baeburania, akhubonekhele efwe. Nono khukhusaba okhufukiilile khuche lukeendo lwe chindaalo chitaru mu sichiimi khuaanile Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wefwe chimbosio.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manyile ndi omwami owa Misiri se acha khumufukiilila muche ne akhayingiliilwe khukhola ario tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali enja khurumikhira bunyali bwase mala ndeere siiuukuumo khu Misiri khubirira mu khukhola bibiindu bie liukia ebweeneyo. Enyuma wako acha khu mulekhuula enywe muche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
